True. (Mind, this is unrelated to the PR.)

> While I was exploring Hell, SmashFan2005 kept me company for while and
> gave me a lot of useful advice (such as about cursed wands causing
> bags to explode) for which I am grateful.  :-)

This may appear helpful to you WRT being more careful how to handle
your bag. Unfortunately this "useful advice" is plain wrong.

Bags of holdings explode if you put in other bags of holding, or bags
of tricks, or charged wands of cancellation. That's it.

Cursed wands, OTOH, (not bags) may explode if you use them. (But the
probability for that is small, just 1%, or so.)

